  - file: Cuneiform_cylinder-_inscription_of_Nebuchadnezzar_II_commemorating_the_reconstruction_of_Etemenanki,_the_ziggurat_at_Babylon_MET_ME86_11_284.jpg
    src: https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fc/Cuneiform_cylinder-_inscription_of_Nebuchadnezzar_II_commemorating_the_reconstruction_of_Etemenanki%2C_the_ziggurat_at_Babylon_MET_ME86_11_284.jpg/250px-Cuneiform_cylinder-_inscription_of_Nebuchadnezzar_II_commemorating_the_reconstruction_of_Etemenanki%2C_the_ziggurat_at_Babylon_MET_ME86_11_284.jpg
    width: 800
    height: 715
